 "title": "MBRS320T3G to MBRS340T3G: 3 A Schottky power rectifiers, 20 V to 40 V, in SMC",
 "source": {
  "document": "MBRS340T3/D",
  "revision": "Rev. 15, August 2021",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A family of single surface-mount Schottky rectifiers in the two-lead SMC (case 403AC) package, rated 3.0 A average at a lead temperature of 110 °C and 80 A surge. The three voltage grades block 20, 30 or 40 V; forward drop is 0.50 V maximum at 3.0 A and 25 °C. Uses named for it are low-voltage high-frequency rectification, freewheeling and polarity protection. The SBRS8 and NRVB prefixes are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable versions for automotive use; MBRS340T3G is the 40 V commercial part.",
